    "abstract": "Parts breakdown of the fan cowl door hinge beam area, showing the stiffened and unstiffened standards as alternates with the two aft intercostals and the hinge fitting gusset.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "Illustrated parts breakdown of the fan cowl door hinge beam, the aft intercostals, the hinge fitting gusset and the drain line restraint hardware.",
      "figure_note": "The figure is drawn looking inboard at the left hand door with the outer panel removed. The alternates at item 10 are the stiffened and unstiffened hinge beam standards. The two intercostals at items 20 and 30 exist only on the stiffened standard and cannot be retrofitted to a door that has been repaired at the aft hinge station without a repair assessment. The cable ties at item 50 are ordered in the quantity for one door; the drain line route differs between the two standards and is shown on sheet 2."
    },
